WEBVTT

00:06:00.528 --> 00:06:01.772
It hurts me, too.

00:06:01.796 --> 00:06:04.619
(Laughter)

00:06:04.643 --> 00:06:06.386
TK: Well, let me start from the top.

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:08.196
Narrator: Number one, keep it simple.

00:06:08.220 --> 00:06:09.396
TK: Keeping it simple.

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:12.994
Narrator: The flag should be so simple
that a child can draw it from memory.

00:06:13.018 --> 00:06:14.887
TK: It's a relatively complex flag.

00:06:14.911 --> 00:06:16.179
RM: OK, here we go, OK.

00:06:16.203 --> 00:06:18.888
The main component
of the San Francisco flag is a phoenix

00:06:18.912 --> 00:06:21.121
representing the city
rising from the ashes

00:06:21.145 --> 00:06:24.187
after the devastating fires of the 1850s.

00:06:24.211 --> 00:06:26.971
TK: A powerful symbol for San Francisco.

00:06:26.995 --> 00:06:28.970
RM: I still don't really dig the phoenix.

00:06:28.994 --> 00:06:31.640
Design-wise, it manages
to both be too crude